# Patch series
#
# Format (whitespace separated, '#' starts a comment):
#   <target directory in the source tree>    <patch path relative to repo root>
#
# Examples (disabled until triaged in phase 4):
#   frameworks/base    patches/rom/0001-example.patch
#   device/xiaomi/blossom  patches/device-tree/0001-example.patch
#
# rules:
#   * applied with `git apply --check` first, build stops on the first failure
#   * keep the series ordered and minimal
#   * every entry must be traceable to an upstream commit or an issue in
#     docs/03-known-issues.md
#
# Upstream crDroid patches under device/xiaomi/blossom/patches are NOT listed
# here. They are applied by the upstream vendorsetup.sh during envsetup; their
# applicability is reported by scripts/00-preflight.sh so conflicts are visible
# in the build log instead of being silently skipped.
